Ordem: CLUSTER → SCALE → FUSION (`fusion_side`) → LOSS_CLF → ANTI_LOSS (flip micro so se Edge vela>=floor; hybrid disagree → `live_discord_weak`; EMA slope/confirm/RSI soft) → NEG_EDGE → KELLY (Single-Strike so ALLOW; Soft_SIZE piso **2.5%** se Edge>=**0.015** com ou sem PEND) → EXEC → RESOLVED. Regressao: Edge`<floor`+EXEC; Soft_SIZE com Edge subfloor; Soft+Edge forte+stake<1%; Soft+PEND+Edge>=0.015+stake≈1%; flip com Edge candle subfloor; Soft+PEND+stake≈cover amort. Proibido narrar “mao quente”.
